{"server":"cn","storyId":"story_estell_set_1_story_1","groupId":"story_estell_set_1","stageId":null,"title":"她的一小步","storyCode":null,"avgTag":"幕间","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_estell_1_1.txt","sourceHash":"b7862a4a2732b50af1ff2b90a40dbc5cf5facae0db24b579991cccde6e28e966","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"艾丝黛尔在罗德岛遇见了同族新同事特米米，惊慌失措的她也想要承担一些照顾新同事的职责。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_trainingcom"},{"type":"narration","text":"9:30 P.M. 训练场"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜宾","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"谢谢你今天帮忙和泡泡对练。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜宾","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"能在力气上游刃有余地压制她的人真的很难找了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜宾","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"陪练到这么晚，辛苦你了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝黛尔","speakerId":"avg_127_estell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（杜宾教官，训练的时候很严格，私底下对人又很好。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝黛尔","speakerId":"avg_127_estell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（她总是很晚睡觉。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝黛尔","speakerId":"avg_127_estell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"今天我也没有别的事情......没关系。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝黛尔","speakerId":"avg_127_estell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（不过，叫泡泡的这个小女孩好厉害。才这么小的年纪。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜宾","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，真希望某些人能学学你啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜宾","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"你肚子也饿了吧，现在有点晚了，你要不去食堂看看还有什么吃的吧？算在我账上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝黛尔","speakerId":"avg_127_estell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谢谢。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_canteen"},{"type":"narration","text":"9:34 P.M. 食堂"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"加热......加热食物的方式......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"是这个机器吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"只有运作的声音，没有热。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"那是这个？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"上面有火的标志。是要用火来加热这个机器吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"先把食物放进机器里，然后在机器外点火......是这样没错吧？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝黛尔","speakerId":"avg_127_estell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"危险——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝黛尔","speakerId":"avg_127_estell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你没事吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"为什么突然爆炸了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝黛尔","speakerId":"avg_127_estell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这个不是这么用的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝黛尔","speakerId":"avg_127_estell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"幸好，你看起来没有什么外伤......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝黛尔","speakerId":"avg_127_estell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（是陌生的同事！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝黛尔","speakerId":"avg_127_estell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（我......我在干什么......下意识就......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"怎、怎么了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝黛尔","speakerId":"avg_127_estell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（还是一个阿达克利斯。是新的阿达克利斯同事吗？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝黛尔","speakerId":"avg_127_estell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"请问一下，我该怎么加热我的食物——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝黛尔","speakerId":"avg_127_estell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"用这台机器......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝黛尔","speakerId":"avg_127_estell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好了......等五分钟后，按这个按钮。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝黛尔","speakerId":"avg_127_estell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那台坏掉的机器，不要动它了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝黛尔","speakerId":"avg_127_estell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"报修之后，会有人来修......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_corridor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝黛尔","speakerId":"avg_127_estell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（我好像又做了很奇怪的事情。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝黛尔","speakerId":"avg_127_estell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（博士和莱娜小姐都希望我能多和人交流......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝黛尔","speakerId":"avg_127_estell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（之前一直拿其他人入职时间比我长，所以太有压迫感之类的来当借口。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝黛尔","speakerId":"avg_127_estell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（这次好像还是一个新同事......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝黛尔","speakerId":"avg_127_estell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（呜......我是不是......没救了。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜宾","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"艾丝黛尔，你吃完了吗，这么快？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝黛尔","speakerId":"avg_127_estell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝黛尔","speakerId":"avg_127_estell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（我好像忘记吃晚饭了。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝黛尔","speakerId":"avg_127_estell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是......吃过了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝黛尔","speakerId":"avg_127_estell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（现在那个人可能还在食堂吧。我晚点的时候再去......）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_forest"},{"type":"narration","text":"9:22 A.M. 疗养庭院"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"调香师","speakerId":"avg_181_flower_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有没有感到放松？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝黛尔","speakerId":"avg_127_estell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝黛尔","speakerId":"avg_127_estell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（莱娜小姐，代号是调香师。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝黛尔","speakerId":"avg_127_estell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（每天这个时候，我会来疗养庭院接受芬芳疗法。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝黛尔","speakerId":"avg_127_estell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（这几乎已经成为了我开始一天生活的方式。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝黛尔","speakerId":"avg_127_estell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（她的身上很香，人也很温柔。如果我以前也有这样一个姐姐就好了。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"调香师","speakerId":"avg_181_flower_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也只有这种气味对你最有效，能让你放松。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝黛尔","speakerId":"avg_127_estell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有一种......家的味道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"调香师","speakerId":"avg_181_flower_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真的吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝黛尔","speakerId":"avg_127_estell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"调香师","speakerId":"avg_181_flower_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可这并不是花香，而是......维生溶液的气味......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"调香师","speakerId":"avg_181_flower_1","isRemote":false,"text":"关于你的过去，如果你想谈论的话，我会听，博士也是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝黛尔","speakerId":"avg_127_estell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"调香师","speakerId":"avg_181_flower_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不强求。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝黛尔","speakerId":"avg_127_estell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谢谢你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝黛尔","speakerId":"avg_127_estell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（我知道自己闻到这种气味会感到放松的原因......这种气味，与我很小的时候在实验室里闻到的完全一样。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝黛尔","speakerId":"avg_127_estell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（那个时候我还没有长出角。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝黛尔","speakerId":"avg_127_estell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（我住在一个小房子里。椭圆形的房间内，有很多这样的小房子。每个小房子里，都住着一个阿达克利斯小孩。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝黛尔","speakerId":"avg_127_estell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（他们喊我“失败品”。后来，我被从实验室扔了出去。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝黛尔","speakerId":"avg_127_estell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（对了，丹尼·奇普，是他把我扔出去的。明明之前，每天早上都隔着玻璃对我说“早上好，我的公主”......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝黛尔","speakerId":"avg_127_estell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（是因为我太不讨喜了，所以被丢弃了吗？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝黛尔","speakerId":"avg_127_estell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（之后我就一直在荒野上生活，直到加入罗德岛。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"调香师","speakerId":"avg_181_flower_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不知道你在思考什么，但是在疗养庭院内，还是伴随着香味好好放松一下吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝黛尔","speakerId":"avg_127_estell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"调香师","speakerId":"avg_181_flower_1","isRemote":false,"text":"最近有好好和人聊天吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝黛尔","speakerId":"avg_127_estell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好像......没有......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"调香师","speakerId":"avg_181_flower_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不用强求，但是如果你有交流的想法，可以找一些你觉得相处起来舒适的人多聊聊天。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"调香师","speakerId":"avg_181_flower_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我能做到的，也就是让你得到短暂的放松。如果真的要走出那样的状态，还是需要靠你自己。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝黛尔","speakerId":"avg_127_estell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"明白了！谢谢你，莱娜小姐。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_corridor"},{"type":"narration","text":"2:15 P.M. 医疗部外走廊"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"微风","speakerId":"avgnew_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"据说又招了一批新同事啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"微风","speakerId":"avgnew_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"罗德岛上的人也越来越多了，这里逐渐热闹起来了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"地灵","speakerId":"avg_183_skgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"食堂打饭的队伍也变长了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"地灵","speakerId":"avg_183_skgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"说起来，我还记得以前人少的时候，照顾新同事还比较方便。现在呢，我连名字都记不过来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"微风","speakerId":"avgnew_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"照顾新同事，不是你这种前辈的责任吗！你看艾雅法拉，以前跟在你身后整天“前辈前辈”地喊你，我想你也有这种照顾新同事的天赋。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羽兽","speakerId":"avg_npc_538_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（欢快的鸣叫）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"微风","speakerId":"avgnew_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哇，这是什么！走廊上有羽兽在乱飞！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"地灵","speakerId":"avg_183_skgoat_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是艾丝黛尔的克莱赫尔爵士，别紧张。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝黛尔","speakerId":"avg_127_estell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对不起！吓到你们了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝黛尔","speakerId":"avg_127_estell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（地灵小姐的头上也有角，对卡普里尼来说并不奇怪。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝黛尔","speakerId":"avg_127_estell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（她的角没我的大，但好像比我的高很多。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝黛尔","speakerId":"avg_127_estell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（如果她在博士办公室被吓一跳的话，角会插到天花板上吗？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝黛尔","speakerId":"avg_127_estell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（要是能跟她熟络起来，我就可以问一问她如何减少双角带来的不便了。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"微风","speakerId":"avgnew_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是艾丝黛尔小姐养的宠物吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝黛尔","speakerId":"avg_127_estell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（微风小姐一如既往地举止优雅......真想开口让她教教我那些礼仪......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝黛尔","speakerId":"avg_127_estell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝黛尔","speakerId":"avg_127_estell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（但克莱赫尔爵士并不是我的宠物，他是我的同伴。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝黛尔","speakerId":"avg_127_estell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（被扔出实验室后，是克莱赫尔爵士最先发现了我，并打开了我的房子。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝黛尔","speakerId":"avg_127_estell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（克莱赫尔爵士懂的比我多，但他总是话很少，而且有点爱说脏话。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"微风","speakerId":"avgnew_275_breeze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对了，下星期预计会有几次外勤支援行动，又要麻烦艾丝黛尔小姐了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝黛尔","speakerId":"avg_127_estell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（因为微风能够熟练地进行战地医疗服务，我和她经常搭班出外勤。也许是感觉到了我的不自然......她对我总是礼貌而又小心翼翼。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝黛尔","speakerId":"avg_127_estell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（很感谢微风，但是这样，也会让我有一点距离感......而且工作之外，私下也不怎么见面......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝黛尔","speakerId":"avg_127_estell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（博士希望我......能自己主动和她沟通......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝黛尔","speakerId":"avg_127_estell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......我会努力好好把病人带回来的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝黛尔","speakerId":"avg_127_estell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（这次也没有说出口。）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝黛尔","speakerId":"avg_127_estell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"克莱赫尔爵士，快回来，别乱飞！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_corridor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝黛尔","speakerId":"avg_127_estell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你这样......会给人添麻烦的......然后我们就会被同事讨厌的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝黛尔","speakerId":"avg_127_estell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"说起来，刚才她们在说的......照顾新同事......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝黛尔","speakerId":"avg_127_estell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"昨天看到的那个阿达克利斯，是不是没人在照顾呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝黛尔","speakerId":"avg_127_estell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果再像那样鲁莽地使用设备，她会受伤的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝黛尔","speakerId":"avg_127_estell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是......我这样的状态......也做不到什么吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克莱赫尔爵士","speakerId":"avg_npc_538_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（意味深长的鸣叫）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝黛尔","speakerId":"avg_127_estell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"克莱赫尔爵士，不要再笑话我啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克莱赫尔爵士","speakerId":"avg_npc_538_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（轻柔的鸣叫）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝黛尔","speakerId":"avg_127_estell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我在乖乖地配合治疗，也每天会去疗养庭院。可是，面对同族的话，还是有点害怕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝黛尔","speakerId":"avg_127_estell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我一眼就能看到......自己和他们的差异......那相对的，他们不也能一眼看出来......我头上的角非常不对劲？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克莱赫尔爵士","speakerId":"avg_npc_538_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（短促的鸣叫）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝黛尔","speakerId":"avg_127_estell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘉维尔？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝黛尔","speakerId":"avg_127_estell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝黛尔","speakerId":"avg_127_estell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘉维尔小姐确实也是阿达克利斯。因为工作的关系我会经常遇到她，但是，我一直没敢开口跟她说话......也不知道她是怎么看我的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝黛尔","speakerId":"avg_127_estell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"明明都是一样的阿达克利斯，嘉维尔小姐却是厉害的医生。而我，好像什么都做不好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"受伤的干员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"等一下！等一下！嘉维尔！我还没准备好！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉维尔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"等什么等，你眼睛一闭一睁，不就完事了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"受伤的干员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"什么一闭一睁......啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝黛尔","speakerId":"avg_127_estell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"今天是嘉维尔小姐在这里值班吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝黛尔","speakerId":"avg_127_estell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"把伤员送到这里来后，如果是嘉维尔小姐值班，就会听到这样的叫声。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝黛尔","speakerId":"avg_127_estell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"里面到底发生了什么呢......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克莱赫尔爵士","speakerId":"avg_npc_538_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（好奇的鸣叫）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝黛尔","speakerId":"avg_127_estell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，你又要去哪——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_corridor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝黛尔","speakerId":"avg_127_estell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（是昨天那个差点被炸伤的女孩！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？你是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝黛尔","speakerId":"avg_127_estell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（被发现了......）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"等等！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"力、力气好大......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝黛尔","speakerId":"avg_127_estell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，糟了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝黛尔","speakerId":"avg_127_estell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你没受伤吧......对不起......我又......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，我没事的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"你的力气好大啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝黛尔","speakerId":"avg_127_estell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......嗯......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝黛尔","speakerId":"avg_127_estell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对不起......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"没关系的啦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"昨天的事，我还得谢谢你。如果没有你的话，我都不知道要怎么加热我的食物。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝黛尔","speakerId":"avg_127_estell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是路过看到了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝黛尔","speakerId":"avg_127_estell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝黛尔","speakerId":"avg_127_estell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我还有别的事情要忙，我得——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉维尔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊，手酸。你帮我看着点伤员，我出去挥一挥拳头放松一下！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉维尔","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"呼！新鲜的空气！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉维尔","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？怎么感觉有人影一闪而过？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉维尔","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"是太累产生了错觉吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_infirmary"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"呼，差点就被发现了。幸好边上还有一个空的诊室。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"这次是我救了你，嘿嘿，我们扯平了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝黛尔","speakerId":"avg_127_estell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"如果被嘉维尔发现的话就不好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝黛尔","speakerId":"avg_127_estell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什、什么意思？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"你是来偷看嘉维尔工作的对吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝黛尔","speakerId":"avg_127_estell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（新来的同事好像误会了......如果不解释清楚的话，会给她留下不好的印象......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝黛尔","speakerId":"avg_127_estell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不是——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"我也是来偷看她工作的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"你和嘉维尔熟吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝黛尔","speakerId":"avg_127_estell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......应该算熟......吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝黛尔","speakerId":"avg_127_estell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（我的工作，经常需要和她交接。但是我们还没怎么说过话。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"你也觉得嘉维尔很好，对吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝黛尔","speakerId":"avg_127_estell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（在罗德岛这样的地方当医生，和像我这样要接受治疗顺便打杂的人，完全不在一个级别上。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝黛尔","speakerId":"avg_127_estell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（这么想想，又可以找到很多理由来说服自己这种逃避的状态是正常的。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝黛尔","speakerId":"avg_127_estell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，是的，我觉得她很厉害。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"那我们就是朋友了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝黛尔","speakerId":"avg_127_estell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"朋友......你愿意和我做朋友？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"我们彼此已经很熟悉了！而且我们也达成了共识——嘉维尔很厉害！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝黛尔","speakerId":"avg_127_estell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好像......是的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"那我们就是朋友。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝黛尔","speakerId":"avg_127_estell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"原来如此。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝黛尔","speakerId":"avg_127_estell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（突然和新来的同事成了朋友......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝黛尔","speakerId":"avg_127_estell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（要快点向博士和莱娜小姐汇报。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝黛尔","speakerId":"avg_127_estell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（虽然不是我主动的，但博士和莱娜小姐一定会为我高兴，然后夸奖我。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"我叫特米米，你的名字呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝黛尔","speakerId":"avg_127_estell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我是......艾丝黛尔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝黛尔","speakerId":"avg_127_estell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（冷静一点，先通过正常的聊天来维持朋友的关系。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝黛尔","speakerId":"avg_127_estell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（加油。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"这是代号吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝黛尔","speakerId":"avg_127_estell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这就是我的名字。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"你的名字，不像一个阿达克利斯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝黛尔","speakerId":"avg_127_estell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"总觉得，这个名字很熟悉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"是灰烬公主的故事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝黛尔","speakerId":"avg_127_estell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你知道她？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"听依娜姆说过。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝黛尔","speakerId":"avg_127_estell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"灰烬公主艾丝黛尔，小时候城堡被坏人占据，她被赶了出来。但是她没有就此沉沦，而是不断练习剑术，不断成长。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝黛尔","speakerId":"avg_127_estell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等时机成熟，她在忠诚的克莱赫尔爵士的帮助下，穿着舞裙混入了城堡的舞会。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝黛尔","speakerId":"avg_127_estell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在舞会的最高潮，她套上了早已准备好的盔甲，接过克莱赫尔爵士扔过来的巨剑，完成复仇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝黛尔","speakerId":"avg_127_estell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有传言说，她完成目标后，便化作了灰烬。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝黛尔","speakerId":"avg_127_estell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝黛尔","speakerId":"avg_127_estell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（一不小心自顾自讲了这么多......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝黛尔","speakerId":"avg_127_estell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（不会引起她的反感吧......我真的不擅长交流，还是少开口比较好......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"好厉害。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"概括得十分准确！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"看得出来你真的很崇拜她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝黛尔","speakerId":"avg_127_estell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......我想成为像她一样的公主。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝黛尔","speakerId":"avg_127_estell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（新同事......好像不是那么可怕......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝黛尔","speakerId":"avg_127_estell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（可惜我没法戴上那样的头盔。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝黛尔","speakerId":"avg_127_estell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（据说罗德岛的铁匠们都很好......可是我一个也不认识。平时战斗的时候，我也不需要使用武器，就从来没去找过他们。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝黛尔","speakerId":"avg_127_estell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（我要加把劲，这样以后就能跟他们说上话，拜托他们为我打造一套公主同款盔甲。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"那样的话，还得练习挥剑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝黛尔","speakerId":"avg_127_estell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝黛尔","speakerId":"avg_127_estell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（还要学习用武器战斗。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝黛尔","speakerId":"avg_127_estell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（跟使用巨剑的同事学习......斯卡蒂......她看起来有些难以靠近......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"不过，你为什么见到我总是要跑？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝黛尔","speakerId":"avg_127_estell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没什么......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝黛尔","speakerId":"avg_127_estell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝黛尔","speakerId":"avg_127_estell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因为......我对我的外表......不是很有自信......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"外表？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"转过来，给我看看。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"如果以我们这里的审美来看，不是很粗，也不是很细......的确属于两边都不算好的状态。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"但是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"这不是正常的状态吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝黛尔","speakerId":"avg_127_estell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......真的吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝黛尔","speakerId":"avg_127_estell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？在你看来，我这样子是正常的吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝黛尔","speakerId":"avg_127_estell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是在我家那边，很多人都拿这个开玩笑，说我是怪胎......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"他们不懂。有时候，这点特征才是美好之处。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"你看，比如说嘉维尔——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝黛尔","speakerId":"avg_127_estell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（啊？嘉维尔以前也长角吗？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"部族里的人喜欢嘉维尔，不仅仅是因为她外表上的东西，更重要的是她很厉害，她能打趴很多人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝黛尔","speakerId":"avg_127_estell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦——哦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝黛尔","speakerId":"avg_127_estell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是应该成为厉害的人吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"不完全是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"我想过这个问题，我想，大家喜欢嘉维尔的原因，其实是，嘉维尔就是嘉维尔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝黛尔","speakerId":"avg_127_estell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不太明白。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"就是，做你自己，喜欢你的人自然会喜欢你。没必要为了讨人喜欢，而走到让自己不舒服的地方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝黛尔","speakerId":"avg_127_estell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真、真的吗！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝黛尔","speakerId":"avg_127_estell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（原来我的双角在阿达克利斯眼中是这样的吗？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"我看过一本书，叫《离自信只差一步》，书里说他人的审美始终是在变化的，最重要的是你如何看待自己。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"等你有空的时候可以找我，我可以把书借给你看。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝黛尔","speakerId":"avg_127_estell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谢谢你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝黛尔","speakerId":"avg_127_estell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可有时候也挺碍事的。比如说去博士办公室的时候，偶尔会戳进门里。想像灰烬公主一样挥剑时，也会影响挥动的范围。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......是会有一点碍事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，先不说平衡身体这样的基本功能，它也可以被当作武器使用。虽然没法自由挥剑，但也可以用它来配合进攻。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"所以从别的角度来说，尾巴也可能是很实用的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝黛尔","speakerId":"avg_127_estell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你说的我明白了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝黛尔","speakerId":"avg_127_estell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（她说的是尾巴......好像理解错我的意思了......我对我的尾巴也十分满意......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝黛尔","speakerId":"avg_127_estell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（头上的角很重，不过有了我的尾巴，我可以轻松地保持平衡。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝黛尔","speakerId":"avg_127_estell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（它是一条好尾巴。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝黛尔","speakerId":"avg_127_estell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（不过她为什么完全不在意我头上的角......看来真的不是每个人都会那么在意这件事......原来同族的阿达克利斯这么好相处......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"像我，就觉得你也很好啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝黛尔","speakerId":"avg_127_estell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真的吗？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，所以我们成了朋友。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"虽然没达到嘉维尔那么好，但也有0.7个嘉维尔那么好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝黛尔","speakerId":"avg_127_estell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谢、谢谢！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝黛尔","speakerId":"avg_127_estell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（在她眼里，“好”的计量单位是嘉维尔吗？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝黛尔","speakerId":"avg_127_estell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（有0.7个嘉维尔那么好，已经是很不错的夸奖了。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝黛尔","speakerId":"avg_127_estell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那博士......有几个嘉维尔那么好？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"没想过欸......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"也许我们之后可以一起为罗德岛上的所有人打分。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝黛尔","speakerId":"avg_127_estell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"用嘉维尔吗......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"是的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝黛尔","speakerId":"avg_127_estell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"那就约好了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，嘉维尔好像回去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"我们继续过去偷看吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝黛尔","speakerId":"avg_127_estell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对不起......我得回去工作了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝黛尔","speakerId":"avg_127_estell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（如果不好好工作的话，万一哪一天罗德岛不要我了......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"有点好奇，艾丝黛尔在罗德岛的工作是什么？我记得你也是战斗小队的吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝黛尔","speakerId":"avg_127_estell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝黛尔","speakerId":"avg_127_estell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（好突然的话题。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝黛尔","speakerId":"avg_127_estell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（这就是朋友间的谈话。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝黛尔","speakerId":"avg_127_estell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我虽然的确是战斗小队的成员，但工作实质上更偏向辅助救援。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝黛尔","speakerId":"avg_127_estell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"比如说负责搬运东西、转运病患或撤离伤员。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝黛尔","speakerId":"avg_127_estell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果战场上有人受伤了，我也可以切入战场，然后带着伤员突围。在这个过程中，可能会发生战斗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝黛尔","speakerId":"avg_127_estell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"偶尔也会护卫我们的医生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"好厉害......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝黛尔","speakerId":"avg_127_estell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"并不是什么特别厉害的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"想象一下，如果有人在战场上受了伤，被敌人包围，不知所措的时候你冲了出来，那会是怎样一副光景。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"他们眼里的你一定是闪着光的，可以达到0.9个嘉维尔那么好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝黛尔","speakerId":"avg_127_estell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真的吗！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝黛尔","speakerId":"avg_127_estell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（原来做这样的工作，也会被人敬仰。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你能把生病或受伤的人送到嘉维尔那边治疗，是不是就更好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝黛尔","speakerId":"avg_127_estell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"0.9个嘉维尔加上1个嘉维尔，那就是8个嘉维尔......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"是的。他们一定可以恢复得更快。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝黛尔","speakerId":"avg_127_estell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对。我以后会尽可能把伤员都送到嘉维尔那边。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝黛尔","speakerId":"avg_127_estell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过......嗯......我......真的得走了，已经到这个时间了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"和你聊天很开心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝黛尔","speakerId":"avg_127_estell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝黛尔","speakerId":"avg_127_estell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（如果以后也能一直保持0.9个嘉维尔的状态就好了。）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_corridor"},{"type":"narration","text":"7:23 P.M. 工程部"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝黛尔","speakerId":"avg_127_estell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（原来交了朋友是这样开心的事情。）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰掌","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？艾丝黛尔你还在忙吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝黛尔","speakerId":"avg_127_estell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝黛尔","speakerId":"avg_127_estell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"微风说下星期可能会有外勤，我想先把一些物资搬到车上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰掌","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"这样可是拿不到加班费的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝黛尔","speakerId":"avg_127_estell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没事的啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝黛尔","speakerId":"avg_127_estell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（灰掌，为罗德岛驾驶地面载具的司机。我和微风出外勤时经常坐他的车。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝黛尔","speakerId":"avg_127_estell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（车顶被改装过，车内空间更大一些，不仅能放更多的物资，更重要的是可以容纳我的角。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝黛尔","speakerId":"avg_127_estell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（和熟悉的人说话，好像就没那么害怕。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰掌","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"你这样的小孩，才更该在下班的时候多休息。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰掌","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"不然年纪大了以后，身体会变差的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰掌","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"你看我，现在颈椎和腰都痛得要死。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰掌","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"再开几次长途，我就要碎成一堆渣了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝黛尔","speakerId":"avg_127_estell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很难受吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰掌","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝黛尔","speakerId":"avg_127_estell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝黛尔","speakerId":"avg_127_estell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想我知道怎么帮你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝黛尔","speakerId":"avg_127_estell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（不知道嘉维尔现在下班了没有。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰掌","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"如果真的管用，那就太感谢你了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰掌","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"等等——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_corridor"},{"type":"narration","text":"8:20 P.M. 医疗部外走廊"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"艾丝黛尔，你又来了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝黛尔","speakerId":"avg_127_estell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我刚刚把身体不舒服的同事送进去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"哇，那看起来嘉维尔还要过一会儿才能下班。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"我是来等嘉维尔一起去吃饭的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝黛尔","speakerId":"avg_127_estell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也要等灰掌大哥治疗完毕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰掌","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"等等，我只是脖子疼！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉维尔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"既然来都来了，我帮你捏一下怎么样？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰掌","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"别......我脖子不疼了，已经好了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰掌","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊啊啊啊——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"听起来很有效。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝黛尔","speakerId":"avg_127_estell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"强力的治疗，总是会很有效的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝黛尔","speakerId":"avg_127_estell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这倒也是哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"你笑什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝黛尔","speakerId":"avg_127_estell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，没什么。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝黛尔","speakerId":"avg_127_estell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（我很高兴有了一个朋友。也很高兴自己能帮上同事的忙。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝黛尔","speakerId":"avg_127_estell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（虽然还是没敢说出口。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝黛尔","speakerId":"avg_127_estell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（在罗德岛生活，没有人会嘲笑我的角，也没有人会因为我笨重的样子而打骂我......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝黛尔","speakerId":"avg_127_estell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（有一种，虽然我没那么优秀，但每天都在进步的感觉。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，好像结束了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉维尔","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"哟，特米米。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"嘉维尔，我今天交到了一个朋友！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"看！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"欸？人呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉维尔","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"哪呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉维尔","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"你是训练得太累出幻觉了吧？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_infirmary"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝黛尔","speakerId":"avg_127_estell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（好险......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝黛尔","speakerId":"avg_127_estell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（又逃跑了。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丝黛尔","speakerId":"avg_127_estell_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（呜......看起来进步得还是十分有限......）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"阿达克利斯少女呼出一口气，把头抬起，将身体——包括双角都贴靠在诊室的墙上。\n明明没有闻到维生溶液的气味，她此刻却由衷地感到放松。\n舷窗外浓厚的夜色与散落的星辰，与她过去十几年来看到的别无二致。\n虽仍在荒野上行走，自己却已然有了名为罗德岛的依靠。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_013_riop","aliases":["灰掌"]},{"speakerId":"char_130_doberm","aliases":["杜宾"]},{"speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","aliases":["嘉维尔"]},{"speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","aliases":["特米米"]}]}
